### Create job (poster) — this internally calls auth-service for invoice check
POST {{jobBaseUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{posterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobTitle":"Test Job",
  "description":"Testing cross-service call",
  "category":"plumbing",
  "jobType":"one-time",
  "workflowType":"daily_wage",
  "location":{"address":"Chennai","lat":13.08,"lng":80.27},
  "salary":{"amount":500,"type":"fixed"}
}

### Accept job (seeker)
PATCH {{jobBaseUrl}}/{{jobId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{seekerToken}}

### Verify job — this internally calls auth-service for candidate match info
PATCH {{jobBaseUrl}}/{{jobId}}/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{seekerToken}}

### Approve job (poster)
PATCH {{jobBaseUrl}}/{{jobId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{posterToken}}

### Confirm (seeker)
PATCH {{jobBaseUrl}}/{{jobId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{seekerToken}}

### Confirm (poster)
PATCH {{jobBaseUrl}}/{{jobId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{posterToken}}

### Finalize — this calls auth-service to update reputation (the real test of the split)
PATCH {{jobBaseUrl}}/{{jobId}}/finalize
Authorization: Bearer {{posterToken}}